# downloads/ holds a copy of the installer for the local mock only. Do not commit it.
# GitHub blocks files over 100 MiB and warns above 50 MiB; this installer is
# 102,888,448 bytes (98.1 MiB), right at that limit, and binaries bloat a Pages repo.
# The real download must be a GitHub Release asset: point CONFIG.downloadUrl in
# app.js (and the fallback hrefs in index.html) at the release URL when hosting is decided.
downloads/
